    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIR\nCALIFORNIA\nTIMETABLE\nEffective July 1, 1979\nSERVING CALIFORNIA AND NEVADA",
      "RENO\nSACRAMENTOT\nLAKE TAHOE\nOAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nSAN JOSE\nMONTEREY\n*SALINAS\nFRESNO\nLAS:\nVEGAS\nONTARIO\nPALM\nSPRINGS\nORANGE\nCOUNTY\nGood connections\nin twelve directions.\nAir California flights to popular\nCalifornia and Nevada destinations now\nconnect with major airlines to serve cities\nthroughout the United States and Canada.\nAIR\nCALIFORNIA\nWe make it easy to fly.\nYour Travel Agent can arrange\nAir California reservations and tours.\nRECEIVED\nJUN 1 2 1979\nROBERT L. MAY"
    ],
